<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN V TASMANIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN V TASMANIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>HOBART, Australia 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard at the close</p>
<p>on the second day of a four-day match between Pakistan and</p>
<p>Tasmania at Bellerive Oval on Friday:</p>
<p>Pakistan first innings 299</p>
<p>Tasmania first innings (overnight 73 for one)</p>
<p> D.Hills c Mohammad Zahid b Mushtaq Ahmed	29</p>
<p> J.Cox not out					  191</p>
<p> D.Marsh st Moin Khan b Mushtaq Ahmed	    28</p>
<p> R.Ponting c and b Mohammad Zahid		  35</p>
<p> M.DiVenuto lbw b Mushtaq Ahmed		    21</p>
<p> D.Boon c Mohammad Zahid b Saqlain Mushtaq     21</p>
<p> S.Young lbw b Mushtaq Ahmed			  6</p>
<p> M.Atkinson not out				    29</p>
<p> Extras (b-2 lb-10 nb-20)			    32</p>
<p> Total (for six wickets, 109 overs)	     392</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-66, 2-156, 3-211, 4-261, 5-314, 6-323.</p>
<p>To bat: M.Hatton, M.Ridgway, J.Saint.</p>
<p>Bowling: Mohammad Zahid 20-4-96-1 (nb-10), Shahid Nazir</p>
<p>13-2-43-0, Wasim Akram 4-2-16-0, Mushtaq Ahmed 29-2-97-4, Ijaz</p>
<p>Ahmed 1-0-18-0 (nb-8), Saqlain Mushtaq 31-10-84-1 (nb-2), Shahid</p>
<p>Afridi 11-2-26-0.</p>
<p>Note: Pakistan bowled 10 no-balls, each worth two runs.</p>
